            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>OBSOLETE An experimentally determined mass that is can be to determine a unique elemental formula. For ions less than 200 u, a measurement with 5 ppm accuracy is sufficient to determine the elemental composition.</obo:IAO_0000115>
