            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A localized region of relatively large ion signal in a mass spectrum. Although peaks are often associated with particular ions, the terms peak and ion should not be used interchangeably.</obo:IAO_0000115>
