        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1000597"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A transmission quadrupole to which an oscillating potential is applied so as to focus a beam of ions through a collision gas with no m/z separation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
