        <owl:annotatedTarget>A transmission quadrupole to which an oscillating potential is applied so as to focus a beam of ions through a collision gas with no m/z separation.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PSI:MS</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
