        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1000597"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The region of a Mathieu stability diagram closest to the origin. Ions within this region can traverse the full length of a transmission quadrupole.</obo:IAO_0000115>
