    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1000339">
        <obo:IAO_0000115>OBSOLETE The mass spectrum recorded from any mass spectrometer in which the appropriate scan function can be set to record the appropriate generation product ion or ions of m/z selected precursor ions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
