        <obo:IAO_0000115>OBSOLETE A mass spectrum recorded from any spectrometer in which the appropriate m/z separation scan function is set to record the product ion or ions of selected precursor ions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>MS</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>MS:1000343</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>This term was made obsolete because it was merged with MSn spectrum (MS:1000580).</rdfs:comment>
