        <obo:IAO_0000115>The 1200 Series LC/MSD SL ion trap belongs to the Agilent LC/MSD ion trap family. It provides fast polarity switching and multisignal data acquisition capabilities in a single run while also providing 5 stages of automated data dependent MS2 and 11 stages of manual MS2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>MS</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>MS:1000467</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>1200 series LC/MSD SL</rdfs:label>
