        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1003952"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The LC/MSD VL ion trap is part of the family of Agilent ion trap mass spectrometers. It has ESI, APCI and APPI ion sources and is a useful ion trap when the amount of sample is not the limiting factor.</obo:IAO_0000115>
