        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1000909"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The transition has been purported by obtaining an MS2 spectrum and demonstrating that the peak is detectable on the instrument specified with a separate term. However, the detecting instrument is of a different type (e.g. ion trap) than the instrument that the transition will eventually be used on (e.g. triple quad).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>MS</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>MS:1000912</oboInOwl:id>
