        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>Only used in Peptide Summary and Select Summary reports. If true, a peptide match must be &apos;bold red&apos; to be included in the report; bold red means the peptide is a top ranking match in a query and appears for the first time (in linear order) in the list of protein hits.</owl:annotatedTarget>
