            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>OBSOLETE FDRScore values specifically obtained for distinct combinations of single, pairs or triplets of search engines making a given PSM, used for integrating results from these distinct pools.</obo:IAO_0000115>
