                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The Paragon method setting indicating the actual digestion agent - unlike other search tools, this setting does not include options that control partial specificity like &apos;semitrypsin&apos;; if trypsin is used, trypsin is set, and partially conforming peptides are found in the Thorough mode of search; &apos;None&apos; should be indicated only if there was really no digestion done.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>MS</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>MS:1002436</oboInOwl:id>
