        <obo:IAO_0000115>A flag on a list of PSMs (SpectrumIdentificationList) to indicate that this is the final set of identifications to be interpreted by consuming software. Amongst the set of SpectrumIdentificationList(s) that are flagged with the term, each spectrum must not be referenced from more than one SpectrumIdentificationResult.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>MS</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>MS:1002439</oboInOwl:id>
