        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1002438"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A flag on a list of PSMs (SpectrumIdentificationList) to indicate that this is not the final set of identifications to be interpreted by consuming software. This term should be used when results are provided from multiple search engines for the results from each search engine before they are combined to give consensus identifications. Amongst the set of SpectrumIdentificationList(s) that are flagged with the term, each spectrum may be referenced from more than one SpectrumIdentificationResult.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>MS</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>MS:1002440</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>intermediate PSM list</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
