        <obo:IAO_0000115>Theoretical m/z of the X component in the adduct (addition product) M+X or M-X. This term was formerly called &apos;adduct ion mass&apos;, but it is not really a mass. It corresponds to the column mislabelled as &apos;mass&apos; at https://fiehnlab.ucdavis.edu/staff/kind/Metabolomics/MS-Adduct-Calculator.</obo:IAO_0000115>
