            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>OBSOLETE Identifies a peak when no de-isotoping has been performed. The value slot reports the isotopomer peak, e.g. &apos;2H&apos;, &apos;13C&apos;, &apos;15N&apos;, &apos;18O&apos;, &apos;31P&apos;.</obo:IAO_0000115>
