        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The number of replicate spectra used during the aggregation process that originate from a specified source (e.g. a file, a dataset, a sample type, etc.). This term must appear in a group alongside a source term, which is one of: &apos;ProteomeXchange accession number&apos;, &apos;constituent spectrum file&apos;, or &apos;sample name&apos;</obo:IAO_0000115>
