        <obo:IAO_0000115>Result of a comparison of an observed fragment ion spectrum to another observed fragment ion spectrum, to assess the plausibility that two spectra originate from the same analyte, e.g., in spectral library searching and spectrum clustering.</obo:IAO_0000115>
