            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Signifies that the crosslinker is cleavable and on cleavage can leave a given stub. The pattern specifies three slots &lt;name&gt;:&lt;mass&gt;:&lt;pairs with&gt;.</obo:IAO_0000115>
