        <obo:IAO_0000115>The theoretical monoisotopic mass of the adduct ion (e.g. for a singly-charged protonated peptide ion, this value would be the neutral peptide molecule&apos;s monoisotopic mass plus the mass of a proton).</obo:IAO_0000115>
