        <obo:IAO_0000115>Molecular sieve stationary phase gas–solid chromatography separates volatile analytes by differential adsorption onto a porous, crystalline aluminosilicate solid phase, enabling selective separation of permanent gases and small hydrocarbons.</obo:IAO_0000115>
