        <obo:IAO_0000115>A tandem instrument that employs three quadrupoles in series, where the first (Q1) acts as a mass filter for precursor ion selection, the second (q2) serves as a collision cell for fragmentation, and the third (Q3) as a mass filter for product ion detection.</obo:IAO_0000115>
