        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_1003903"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An analytical approach in which a predefined set of analytes is measured, typically enabling quantitative determination.</obo:IAO_0000115>
