        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>RT-Duration</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>MS:4000053</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Longer duration may indicate a better chromatographic separation of compounds which depends, however, also on the sampling/scan rate of the MS instrument.</rdfs:comment>
