        <obo:IAO_0000115>OBSOLETE. The log ratios of successive TIC quartiles. The metric&apos;s value triplet represents the log ratios of TIC-Q2 to TIC-Q1, TIC-Q3 to TIC-Q2, TIC-max to TIC-Q3.</obo:IAO_0000115>
