        <rdfs:comment>The metric informs about the dynamic range of the acquisition. Based on the used MS instrument configuration, the values should be similar. Variations between measurements may arise when employing acquisition in DDA mode.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>m/z acquisition range</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
