        <owl:annotatedTarget>The number of data points detected for quantification purposes within the run. These data points may be for example XIC profiles, isotopic pattern areas, or reporter ions (see MS:1001805). The used type should be noted in the metadata or analysis methods section of the recording file for the respective run.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PSI:MS</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
