        <obo:IAO_0000115>The interval used for acquisition of quantiles of all MS1 events divided by retention time duration. The number of values in the tuple implies the quantile mode.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>MS</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>RT-MS-Q1</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>RT-MS-Q2</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>RT-MS-Q3</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>RT-MS-Q4</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>MS:4000184</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>The metric informs about the dynamic range of the acquisition along the chromatographic separation. For MS1 scans, the values are expected to be in a similar range across samples of the same type.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>MS1 quantile RT fraction</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
