        <oboInOwl:id>MS:4000185</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>The metric informs about the dynamic range of the acquisition along the chromatographic separation. For MS2 scans, the comparability of the values depends on the acquisition mode and settings to select ions for fragmentation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>MS2 quantile RT fraction</rdfs:label>
