        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MS_4000188"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>The interval used for acquisition of quantiles of all identified MS2 events, after user-defined acceptance criteria are applied, divided by retention time duration. The number of values in the tuple implies the quantile mode. In case of multiple acceptance criteria (FDR) available in proteomics, PSM-level FDR should be used for better comparability.</owl:annotatedTarget>
