        <obo:IAO_0000115>The fraction of identified peptides with corresponding number of missed cleavages after user-defined acceptance criteria are applied. The number of missed cleavages per peptide is given in the &apos;number of missed cleavages&apos; column, the respective fraction of such peptides identified in the &apos;fraction&apos; column. The highest &apos;missed cleavages&apos; row is to be interpreted as that number of missed cleavages or higher.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>MS</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>MS:4000215</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>missed cleavages fractions</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
